# Ambulatory Reactor's granted "{T}: Add {C}. Spend this mana only to cast an artifact spell or activate an ability of an
# artifact source." (CR 106.6). Turn 3: the Reactor taps for one restricted {C}; with two untapped Islands beside it,
# Changeling Wayfinder ({3}, a nonartifact creature) would be castable if the {C} could count, so its refusal shows the
# mana cannot pay for it. That same {C} casts Sol Ring, an artifact spell (`Spend: C`), leaving both Islands untapped.
# Bot1's Ornithopter - another artifact creature the Reactor's static grants the ability - then taps for the next {C},
# and Mind Stone is cast with the Islands' {U}{U} (`Spend: U, U`) so that only the {C} is left to pay Mind Stone's
# "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card", an ability of an artifact source.

